"""Patina 0.34.0: debris where it gathers, and a roof that drains through its parapet (the factory's roadmap 324).

`surface_dressing.plan` thins open ground's debris by its distance to the nearest building, wall base or kerb, and
keeps weeds and rubble at those edges; `framing.scupper_sides` leaves out the gutter under a parapet on a building
that is not an Empty and orders its downspouts `head` to the roof's surface (Zoo >= 1.147.0 builds the scupper).

Proven: tests/test_scuppers.py and tests/test_debris_edges.py fail on 0.33.1 (fails_on_old.out.txt); the clone's
suite, 408 passed, 11 skipped (suite_clone.out.txt); the vertical slice rebuilt and priced against slice 1 (the
factory's docs/findings/slice_look/).
"""
